# Public, non-secret settings used by `next build` and `next start` in production.
# Committed on purpose: NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are baked into the browser bundle, so
# every visitor receives them anyway; row level security protects the data.
# Host environment variables (DigitalOcean > Settings > Environment Variables)
# override these. NEVER put secrets here (service_role key, API tokens, passwords).
